# Everything listed here is excluded from the build context - the snapshot of
# files Docker uploads to the daemon before building.
#
# This matters for speed AND correctness: target/ can hold hundreds of megabytes
# of compiled output from a host build, and copying it in would both slow the
# build and risk mixing host-compiled classes into the image.

target/
*.jar
*.war

.git/
.gitignore

.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
.settings/
.classpath
.project

*.md
